# Devices whose USB `adb install` hangs — listed by serial OR model substring,
# one per line (# comments allowed). Matching devices skip USB and use wireless
# automatically in run.sh. WIFI=1 forces wireless for anything.
#
# The real fix for ColorOS/OxygenOS is enabling Developer options >
# "Install via USB" on the device; if that doesn't help (flaky port), list it here.

# OnePlus Pad 2 — USB install hangs; use wireless.
OPD2480
